<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Blue in 3-for-40 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Blue in 3-for-40 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Diamonds Jewellery Worldwide Ltd said on Tuesday it was offering a three-for-40 bonus issue.</p>
<p>The issue will increase the company's share capital to 54.82 million shares from 51 million. The issue date will be announced later.</p>
<p>Blue Diamonds manufactures gold and gem-studden jewellery, mostly for export.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom tel 941-434319</p>
</text>
